Teksto ora: ['html'] hasi: { <- (
		mes
		remplasá: ['&'] ku: ['&amp;'],
		remplasá: ['<'] ku: ['&lt;'],
		remplasá: ['>'] ku: ['&gt;'],
		remplasá: ['"'] ku: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Lista nobo.

['Verbatim Syntax'] lèternan kada: { :number :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (number), Letter: letter).
}.

Salida list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list uni: ['↵']).

Salida skirbi: template.

